WEBVTT

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:05.095
Space: The final frontier.

00:00:05.179 --> 00:00:09.058
These are the voyages
of the spaceship Catia Ship.

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:11.727
Its 21st-century mission,
under a next-generation crew,

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:15.940
to explore new worlds,
to seek out new life and civilizations,

00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:20.277
to boldly go where
no Catian has gone before.

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.412
I'm still inexperienced

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:36.210
There are many answers before my eyes

00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:43.425
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:45.302
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:00:45.386 --> 00:00:47.054
I want them all to myself

00:00:47.137 --> 00:00:50.516
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:00:50.599 --> 00:00:58.232
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:00:58.315 --> 00:01:00.025
Why don't you get serious?

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:05.239
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:01:05.322 --> 00:01:11.996
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:01:12.079 --> 00:01:16.083
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:19.962
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:01:20.045 --> 00:01:26.844
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:01:26.927 --> 00:01:30.889
I want the original

00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:34.602
of your heart, at least,

00:01:34.685 --> 00:01:38.606
and I've put together a plan

00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:46.905
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.372
The Saitama Super Arena:

00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:59.960
An adjustable event hall that can
accommodate up to 37,000 people.

00:02:01.337 --> 00:02:03.088
Here, at this moment,

00:02:03.172 --> 00:02:07.051
a certain group is holding a top-secret gathering.

00:02:11.138 --> 00:02:12.723
Mee-ow!

00:02:12.806 --> 00:02:15.267
Mee-ow!

00:02:15.351 --> 00:02:16.352
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.896
we are fans of cats!

00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:21.065
Nay!

00:02:21.148 --> 00:02:23.567
To be more accurate,
we are fans of kitty ears, kitty tails,

00:02:23.651 --> 00:02:28.739
and all other kitty parts,
and the meow-y, me-wow-y feeling,

00:02:28.822 --> 00:02:31.075
sensations, and character that they produce.

00:02:31.158 --> 00:02:33.369
No, that doesn't cover it.

00:02:33.452 --> 00:02:35.704
We adore them! We love them!

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.207
L-O-V-E...

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.251
...|-N-G them!

00:02:43.545 --> 00:02:45.130
However...

00:02:47.257 --> 00:02:49.343
...we are but phonies!

00:02:49.426 --> 00:02:52.554
All we can do is be content with being phonies!

00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:58.811
Why is that? Because we are
creatures descended from apes!

00:02:58.894 --> 00:03:00.562
This is our curse!

00:03:01.772 --> 00:03:02.773
However,

00:03:02.856 --> 00:03:06.360
the other day,
the Good News appeared from above!

00:03:06.443 --> 00:03:07.820
Behold!

00:03:10.155 --> 00:03:12.825
Genuine kitty ears!

00:03:12.908 --> 00:03:14.493
And tail!

00:03:15.452 --> 00:03:19.790
Magnificent! What a divine directive!
What divine mercy!

00:03:19.873 --> 00:03:22.251
This happenstance is like a chance of fate!

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.795
Indeed, he who seeks shall be saved!

00:03:24.878 --> 00:03:28.716
To think that a genuine kitty-eared
girl should appear before us!

00:03:31.051 --> 00:03:33.512
| declare to you now...

00:03:33.595 --> 00:03:36.765
...that those of us in the kitty-ear ranks
of the Underside of the Kitten's Paw,

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:40.811
welcome and worship
this person as our true guru!

00:03:40.894 --> 00:03:44.982
As of now, we are implementing
"Operation Unya!"

00:03:45.065 --> 00:03:46.692
Mee-ow!!

00:03:46.775 --> 00:03:48.569
Mee-ow!I!!

00:03:48.652 --> 00:03:50.195
Mee-ow!!

00:03:50.279 --> 00:03:52.239
Mee-ow!I!!

00:04:06.503 --> 00:04:11.341
If a woman doesn't mention her past,
she may as well not have one.

00:04:11.425 --> 00:04:14.178
It's not exactly that cut and dried, you know.

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:17.264
Coming!

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:19.892
Huh?

00:04:23.687 --> 00:04:25.272
Black cats?

00:04:26.482 --> 00:04:27.274
"Catian Ambassy"

00:04:27.691 --> 00:04:29.067
Good morning.

00:04:35.282 --> 00:04:39.411
...fry-fry-fried potstickers...

00:04:40.704 --> 00:04:41.955
Eris?

00:04:42.039 --> 00:04:46.335
Oh, Kio! Good morning to you!

00:04:46.418 --> 00:04:47.878
What's come over you, Eris?

00:04:47.961 --> 00:04:51.423
Today, I'm having
early-morning fried potstickers!

00:04:51.507 --> 00:04:56.011
I'm so happy,
| couldn't help but start dancing!

00:04:57.304 --> 00:04:58.764
Sorry, Kio.

00:04:59.765 --> 00:05:02.601
Mom was doing some
online shopping, you see.

00:05:02.684 --> 00:05:05.562
| brought it over,
thinking I would share it with her,

00:05:05.646 --> 00:05:07.523
but Eris didn't realize what was inside.

00:05:07.523 --> 00:05:08.148
"Cat powder"
but Eris didn't realize what was inside.

00:05:08.148 --> 00:05:08.232
"Cat powder"

00:05:08.232 --> 00:05:09.358
"Cat powder"
Cat powder?!

00:05:09.358 --> 00:05:09.733
Cat powder?!

00:05:09.817 --> 00:05:11.026
You don't mean...

00:05:11.109 --> 00:05:13.529
She just took a little whiff of the smell!

00:05:13.612 --> 00:05:16.490
So cats really do get
intoxicated from cat powder.

00:05:17.366 --> 00:05:20.619
I'm all right! I'm not drunk!

00:05:20.702 --> 00:05:22.704
No, Eris, no more!

00:05:22.788 --> 00:05:25.082
Aw, come on!

00:05:25.165 --> 00:05:27.876
| want some too!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.878
C-Cut it out, Eris!

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:32.256
Hey, Eris, enough already!

00:05:32.339 --> 00:05:34.258
Let go of it!

00:05:36.009 --> 00:05:41.098
| know! I'll get Kio to
feed it to me mouth-to-mouth!

00:05:42.391 --> 00:05:46.770
I'll take it from you mouth-to-mouth.

00:05:46.854 --> 00:05:48.230
No!

00:05:54.778 --> 00:05:57.281
My, my, what a scene.

00:05:57.364 --> 00:05:58.824
Doctor Durel!

00:05:58.907 --> 00:06:00.576
What did you inject her with?

00:06:00.659 --> 00:06:03.328
It wasn't a shot. It was a taser.

00:06:03.412 --> 00:06:07.541
It sent an electric pulse directly to
her nerves, knocking her out.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.253
Huh? What could have happened to me?

00:06:11.336 --> 00:06:14.923
Eris, isn't your mating season
right around the corner?

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:16.592
--Mating season?!
--Mating season?!

00:06:16.675 --> 00:06:20.470
In our race, once one passes their 16th cycle,

00:06:20.554 --> 00:06:24.433
they start having regular seasons of fertility.

00:06:24.516 --> 00:06:25.392
So,

00:06:25.475 --> 00:06:27.185
as their mating season approaches,

00:06:27.269 --> 00:06:30.105
their brain chemistry can get a bit wild,

00:06:30.188 --> 00:06:33.317
and it becomes easy for them to
become high with even a little bit of alcohol.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.986
So just the scent of that cat powder...

00:06:36.069 --> 00:06:38.030
You're pretty fortunate, Eris.

00:06:38.113 --> 00:06:41.617
Lucky for you, you have a partner
for your very first mating season.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:44.244
Typically, you'd need a simulator.

00:06:44.328 --> 00:06:45.954
Aw, geez, Doctor...

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:47.581
P-Partner...?

00:06:48.665 --> 00:06:50.792
Why, Kio, of course.

00:06:50.876 --> 00:06:52.044
Y-You can't!

00:06:52.127 --> 00:06:56.048
In Japan, people who are
underage aren't allowed to do that!

00:06:57.299 --> 00:06:58.842
That's all right.

00:06:58.926 --> 00:07:01.428
This house is the provisional Catian Embassy,

00:07:01.511 --> 00:07:03.847
so we have extraterritorial jurisdiction.

00:07:03.931 --> 00:07:04.848
No problem.

00:07:04.932 --> 00:07:06.600
Huge problem!

00:07:06.683 --> 00:07:10.604
| was to understand that Kio
didn't have a fiancée or a partner.

00:07:10.687 --> 00:07:12.189
What is the problem?

00:07:12.272 --> 00:07:13.565
W-Well...

00:07:13.649 --> 00:07:17.027
Hey, Kio, step in here and say something!

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:21.573
Huh? Oh, er, I, um...
I'm going to go clean my room.

00:07:22.574 --> 00:07:24.868
Hey! Why are you running away?!

00:07:24.952 --> 00:07:27.454
We're talking about you, you know!

00:07:28.747 --> 00:07:31.083
You're sure you're okay with him?

00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:33.961
Yes. Despite how it looks,
he really is quite brave,

00:07:34.044 --> 00:07:36.630
as well as gallant.

00:07:36.713 --> 00:07:38.674
You don't say.

00:07:38.757 --> 00:07:43.261
By the way, Doctor Durel,
what brings you here today?

00:07:43.345 --> 00:07:45.347
A request from the ship.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.432
They want you to go to Tokyo.

00:07:47.516 --> 00:07:48.976
Tokyo?

00:07:49.977 --> 00:07:52.896
"First, lick the master key memory terminal,

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.982
and press the transmit button.”

00:07:55.065 --> 00:07:56.858
This thing, right?

00:08:00.988 --> 00:08:02.531
"You are now recognized
as the override commander.

00:08:02.531 --> 00:08:05.075
"Assistroid Startup Guide" "You are now
recognized as the override commander.

00:08:05.075 --> 00:08:05.158
"Assistroid Startup Guide"

00:08:05.158 --> 00:08:06.159
"Assistroid Startup Guide" Next is the startup
test. Please give an order that is possible."”

00:08:06.159 --> 00:08:10.122
Next is the startup test. Please
give an order that is possible."

00:08:10.205 --> 00:08:12.457
All right, stand up.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:14.876
Okay then,

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.629
your name will be Kin-chan.

00:08:17.713 --> 00:08:19.423
You will be Chiba-chan.

00:08:19.506 --> 00:08:20.924
Got it?

00:08:21.008 --> 00:08:23.802
Now then, do a small jump, hop to the side,

00:08:23.885 --> 00:08:26.847
twirl three times, and do a "beckoning cat."

00:08:35.772 --> 00:08:38.734
"Now, please give an
order that is impossible."

00:08:38.817 --> 00:08:40.819
Okay then, let's see...

00:08:41.445 --> 00:08:41.862
"Quick-draw Gunman"

00:08:41.862 --> 00:08:43.030
"Quick-draw Gunman"
| know.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:43.447
| know.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:46.783
Do a quick-draw. Like you were Joe the Ace.

00:08:57.085 --> 00:08:58.253
Here.

00:09:15.395 --> 00:09:19.274
"If functioning properly, when
given an impossible command,

00:09:19.357 --> 00:09:21.068
they will commit seppuku.

00:09:21.151 --> 00:09:24.863
Issue an abort command within ten seconds.”

00:09:24.946 --> 00:09:26.364
Stop!

00:09:30.327 --> 00:09:36.541
Now I wish I hadn't said
| liked my mecha tuned so peaky.

00:09:37.542 --> 00:09:39.503
The cats are going to Tokyo?

00:09:39.586 --> 00:09:42.547
Yes, ma'am. They may plan
to move their diplomacy forward,

00:09:42.631 --> 00:09:46.802
or to spread word of
their existence even wider.

00:09:46.885 --> 00:09:50.013
Hmph, this is pretty aggressive, for them.

00:09:51.306 --> 00:09:52.432
I'm off.

00:09:52.516 --> 00:09:54.559
I'm heading for Japan, too.

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:06.321
Kio!

00:10:06.947 --> 00:10:11.743
This is my first time being in
an aircraft that uses aerodynamic lift.

00:10:11.827 --> 00:10:14.538
| wonder what it feels like. I can't wait!

00:10:14.621 --> 00:10:17.207
Mm-hmm, sure.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.709
There are a lot of people in Tokyo.

00:10:19.793 --> 00:10:23.255
As her security personnel,
isn't that outfit a little attention-getting?

00:10:23.338 --> 00:10:27.050
It's less attention-getting
the more people there are.

00:10:27.134 --> 00:10:28.718
Maybe you're right.

00:10:28.802 --> 00:10:30.178
Excuse me, sir...

00:10:30.262 --> 00:10:31.221
Yes?

00:10:31.304 --> 00:10:36.101
About your traveling companion,
or pet robot, or whatever it is...

00:10:38.061 --> 00:10:39.229
Ah...

00:10:39.312 --> 00:10:42.732
It's all right. It won't do any harm to anyone,

00:10:42.816 --> 00:10:44.651
and it doesn't emit any EM interference.

00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:47.487
No, I mean, we are preparing to take off,

00:10:47.571 --> 00:10:50.574
so if it could take a seat,
or be stowed with the baggage...

00:10:50.657 --> 00:10:52.033
All right.

00:10:52.117 --> 00:10:53.994
Come on back here.

00:10:59.583 --> 00:11:02.210
Okay then, in the overhead, if you please.

00:11:02.294 --> 00:11:03.503
R-Right...

00:11:04.629 --> 00:11:06.882
She is drawing a lot of attention.

00:11:07.007 --> 00:11:08.049
"Guide to Sites of Tokyo"

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.887
Oh, the poor thing.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:16.308
We have some empty seats today,
so have him sit in a seat, too.

00:11:16.391 --> 00:11:17.100
Right.

00:11:17.142 --> 00:11:19.102
Thank you very much.

00:11:19.186 --> 00:11:21.062
Okay, go back!

00:11:22.439 --> 00:11:24.733
"Thank you"

00:11:24.733 --> 00:11:26.193
"Thank you"
Oh, my.

00:11:26.193 --> 00:11:26.568
"Thank you"

00:11:30.071 --> 00:11:30.822
"Anonymous flyer"

00:11:31.323 --> 00:11:32.574
