00:11:32.657 --> 00:11:34.784
"Companions... Boy:
1 Girls: 2 Robots: 1"

00:11:34.868 --> 00:11:36.161
"(Totally pretty!)"

00:11:44.711 --> 00:11:46.588
Cat Planet Cuties!

00:11:56.681 --> 00:11:59.351
