00:12:00.644 --> 00:12:03.146
Eris, where are we headed now?

00:12:04.439 --> 00:12:06.233
Oh, about that...

00:12:08.777 --> 00:12:10.862
This is our destination?

00:12:10.946 --> 00:12:13.073
This is Nakano Broadway.

00:12:13.156 --> 00:12:14.741
You're surveying this place?

00:12:14.824 --> 00:12:17.911
Yes. The arts research team asked
me to examine the relationship

00:12:17.994 --> 00:12:21.373
