knowledge with regards to finance.

00:12:21.456 --> 00:12:24.042
It's a scientific technology
and mechanical technology survey.

00:12:24.125 --> 00:12:25.585
Specifically...?

00:12:25.669 --> 00:12:29.130
They asked me to buy them
lots of toys and manga books.

00:12:31.758 --> 00:12:35.804
The position of Catian cultural anthropology

00:12:35.887 --> 00:12:38.890
is that cultural level is revealed by
what the people dismiss as lowbrow

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:39.140
"Adult Goods Store" is that cultural level is
revealed by what the people dismiss as lowbrow

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:39.224
"Adult Goods Store"

00:12:39.224 --> 00:12:42.644
"Adult Goods Store" even more
than what they consider to be highbrow.

00:12:42.644 --> 00:12:42.686
"Adult Goods Store"

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.354
"Bells and Whistles"

00:12:44.354 --> 00:12:45.647
"Bells and Whistles"
Say, Kio...

00:12:45.647 --> 00:12:46.231
Say, Kio...

00:12:46.314 --> 00:12:50.026
We are the first aliens
to come to your world, right?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:52.487
Well, I believe that's true.

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.531
What is that?

00:12:55.907 --> 00:12:58.118
Th-That's... um... well, that is to say...

00:12:58.201 --> 00:13:00.287
I-I'll explain it later.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.622
Come on, we need to get you your materials.

00:13:05.417 --> 00:13:06.793
Aoi...

00:13:11.172 --> 00:13:14.676
Excuse me,
do you have the items on this list?

00:13:14.759 --> 00:13:17.595
Let's see. One moment, please.

00:13:17.679 --> 00:13:20.849
He didn't think Eris'
outfit was out of the ordinary.

00:13:20.932 --> 00:13:22.475
Excuse me, miss.

00:13:22.976 --> 00:13:25.061
Is this yours?

00:13:25.145 --> 00:13:25.979
Yes.

00:13:26.062 --> 00:13:28.023
Excuse me for a bit.

00:13:30.191 --> 00:13:32.819
He didn't find the
Assistroid to be unusual, either.

00:13:32.902 --> 00:13:34.195
As a population,

00:13:34.279 --> 00:13:38.074
you have a higher adaptability
to different cultures than I thought.

00:13:39.326 --> 00:13:41.953
R-Right. Oh, where's Kio?

00:13:46.207 --> 00:13:47.917
Hey, what are you doing?

00:13:48.001 --> 00:13:50.754
You're supposed to be here
as Eris' bodyguard, aren't you?

00:13:50.837 --> 00:13:52.756
Yeah, but here! Look!

00:13:52.839 --> 00:13:56.343
I've never seen a real BC-FX before!

00:13:56.426 --> 00:13:58.136
Geez, you go keep an eye out

00:13:58.219 --> 00:14:01.473
to make sure that
no one funny comes near Eris.

00:14:03.141 --> 00:14:04.517
Aoi...?

00:14:09.105 --> 00:14:10.315
Aoi!

00:14:10.398 --> 00:14:11.775
W-What, Manami?

00:14:11.858 --> 00:14:13.860
Mm-mm, it's just that Kio...

00:14:13.943 --> 00:14:15.945
Uh...

00:14:16.029 --> 00:14:17.489
I-I'm going on ahead.

00:14:17.572 --> 00:14:19.157
When you're done with
your shopping, catch up, okay?

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:20.283
O-Okay.

00:14:20.367 --> 00:14:21.701
--I'll be there in two minutes.

00:14:21.701 --> 00:14:22.869
--Thanks.
--I'll be there in two minutes.

00:14:25.622 --> 00:14:26.456
"Tales of Yagyu"

00:14:26.456 --> 00:14:28.249
"Tales of Yagyu"
You want that?

00:14:28.249 --> 00:14:28.750
"Tales of Yagyu"

