00:14:34.964 --> 00:14:38.301
I-Is that a Chiappa Rhino .357 Magnum?!

00:14:38.385 --> 00:14:40.428
They don't even have an airgun version of this!

00:14:40.512 --> 00:14:41.763
It's a first-rate piece,

00:14:41.846 --> 00:14:44.391
