00:14:53.191 --> 00:14:53.525
"DVD Store"

00:14:53.525 --> 00:14:54.734
"DVD Store"
Where is everyone?

00:14:54.734 --> 00:14:55.402
Where is everyone?

00:14:58.655 --> 00:15:00.490
It couldn't be...!

00:15:00.573 --> 00:15:03.952
A Nikkatsu Colt,
actually used in a movie shoot?!

00:15:04.035 --> 00:15:05.995
Would you like a closer look?

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.541
These don't become available too often.

00:15:09.624 --> 00:15:11.084
They don't?

00:15:11.167 --> 00:15:12.961
No, they don't.

00:15:16.714 --> 00:15:19.008
All right, your packages are in good hands.

00:15:20.301 --> 00:15:22.262
The packing is all done.

00:15:22.345 --> 00:15:25.932
This place is amazing, huh?
Let's come here again.

00:15:27.225 --> 00:15:28.935
My whole month's allowance...

00:15:29.018 --> 00:15:33.064
Why do you keep moping?
A real man wouldn't have any regrets.

00:15:33.148 --> 00:15:36.693
Yeah, but... Manami,
how much did you spend?

00:15:37.986 --> 00:15:40.655
You spent so much that you can't answer.

00:15:43.658 --> 00:15:44.659
Oh, no...

00:15:44.742 --> 00:15:46.578
Aoi, are you having regrets, too?

00:15:46.661 --> 00:15:48.580
We've been baited here.

00:15:48.663 --> 00:15:50.582
On a Saturday afternoon,

00:15:50.665 --> 00:15:53.084
there's no way this train station is this empty.

00:15:56.296 --> 00:15:58.798
You're saying there's some power at work here?

00:15:58.882 --> 00:16:01.426
Whether it's Taoist wizardry
or some western style, I'm not sure,

00:16:01.509 --> 00:16:03.261
but there is a magician here.

00:16:03.344 --> 00:16:07.891
They've cast a spell to keep
everyone else but us away from here.

00:16:07.974 --> 00:16:09.017
What do we do?

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.895
You get on the train with Kakazu and Eris.

00:16:11.978 --> 00:16:14.939
I'll be along once I take
care of whoever set this up.

00:16:15.899 --> 00:16:18.735
Chiba-chan, Kin-chan, look after the others.

00:16:19.235 --> 00:16:20.320
IIRogerll

00:16:26.826 --> 00:16:29.954
Ho, a barrier created with spiritrons, huh?

00:16:30.038 --> 00:16:31.998
Yes. A barrier to keep others out.

00:16:32.081 --> 00:16:34.834
Not bad, setting this up in the middle of Tokyo.

00:16:34.918 --> 00:16:37.003
You're sure it's not
the Japanese government?

00:16:37.086 --> 00:16:40.507
Yes. Neither CIRO, the Immigration Bureau,

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:44.385
nor even Public Safety
has shown the least bit of activity.

00:16:45.678 --> 00:16:47.805
Which leaves... who?

00:16:51.392 --> 00:16:53.353
Four-eyes has taken the bait.

00:16:54.604 --> 00:16:57.273
Short-hair, the three runts, and the tagalong

00:16:57.357 --> 00:16:59.567
are aboard the train with the subject.

00:17:00.568 --> 00:17:02.487
Phase two complete.

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:05.156
Moving on to phase three.
Team A, make absolutely sure

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:07.951
not to harm the Divine Embodiment,
nor the tagalong.

00:17:08.034 --> 00:17:11.120
Team B and I will
keep Charmed Momiji occupied.

00:17:11.204 --> 00:17:12.705
Do not hold back against her!

00:17:12.789 --> 00:17:14.165
Roger.

00:17:23.508 --> 00:17:24.551
A glamour?

00:17:24.634 --> 00:17:27.178
Inbound central line, platform 8,

00:17:27.262 --> 00:17:30.223
there will be a 30-minute delay
due to an accident.

00:17:30.306 --> 00:17:30.598
--We appreciate your patience today.

00:17:30.598 --> 00:17:34.143
--Oh, no, then the train Kakazu and the others are on...
--We appreciate your patience today.

00:17:36.229 --> 00:17:37.188
What is it?

00:17:37.272 --> 00:17:39.607
There aren't any ads on this train.

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.485
You're right.

00:17:46.072 --> 00:17:47.574
What is this? Alcohol?

00:17:47.657 --> 00:17:48.992
For some reason, I'm losing it...

00:17:49.075 --> 00:17:50.451
Eris!

00:17:53.246 --> 00:17:54.372
"Please stop"

00:17:59.252 --> 00:18:00.378
Manami!

00:18:00.461 --> 00:18:02.046
L-Let go!

00:18:04.549 --> 00:18:06.884
Kio! Eris!

00:18:06.968 --> 00:18:08.761
Go after them!

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:11.806
No way!

00:18:13.141 --> 00:18:14.642
What is this?!

00:18:14.726 --> 00:18:16.978
| am not a cockroach!

00:18:21.232 --> 00:18:22.609
Oh, no!

00:18:23.568 --> 00:18:25.153
They got us!

00:18:25.737 --> 00:18:27.280
Never mind about me, go after them!

00:18:27.363 --> 00:18:28.740
Acknowledged!

00:18:33.119 --> 00:18:34.704
Apport!

00:18:46.382 --> 00:18:47.759
Gotcha!

00:18:51.679 --> 00:18:52.764
Where is Kakazu?

00:18:52.847 --> 00:18:55.099
We don't take any fare jumpers!

00:19:06.611 --> 00:19:08.905
Have to go after them...

00:19:12.575 --> 00:19:14.410
Shore duty sure is nice, all right.

00:19:14.494 --> 00:19:17.163
| wonder if Eris would just switch with me.

00:19:22.752 --> 00:19:24.879
Yes, this is Chayka.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.216
Eris has been kidnapped?!

00:19:30.551 --> 00:19:33.304
Right now, we can't do anything political.

00:19:33.388 --> 00:19:36.265
We still haven't formalized
our friendship treaty.

00:19:36.349 --> 00:19:41.646
We understand that. But it's
still okay for us to rescue her, right?

00:19:41.729 --> 00:19:45.858
Of course. You two are
already there in the field, after all.

00:19:45.942 --> 00:19:48.986
Can you send us an electronic-warfare
specialized Assistroid?

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.029
Let me have that.

00:19:50.113 --> 00:19:51.864
Also, send my own unit.

00:19:51.948 --> 00:19:53.324
Okay!

00:19:56.077 --> 00:19:58.705
Manami, that's your Assistroid?

00:19:58.788 --> 00:20:01.124
Mm-hmm. I call him "Yun-fat."

00:20:09.465 --> 00:20:10.925
I-Incredible...

00:20:11.008 --> 00:20:14.262
It's one of the
Immigration Bureau's secret depots.

00:20:14.345 --> 00:20:17.974
Brace yourself.
Things could get a little rough from here on.

00:20:39.412 --> 00:20:40.621
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:20:40.705 --> 00:20:43.791
our Divine Embodiment is fast asleep.

00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:46.294
The Divine Embodiment,

00:20:46.377 --> 00:20:49.338
who possesses heaven-sent
real ears and a real tail,

00:20:49.422 --> 00:20:53.634
will lead the Underside of
the Kitten's Paw into our utopia!

00:20:53.718 --> 00:20:56.679
With our dreams upon our paw pads,

00:20:56.763 --> 00:20:58.306
Mee-ow!!

00:20:58.389 --> 00:21:02.685
Mee-ow!! Mee-ow!!

00:21:02.769 --> 00:21:04.479
The Underside of the Kitten's Paw?

00:21:04.562 --> 00:21:07.023
It's a quasi-religious organization

00:21:07.106 --> 00:21:09.400
that has quickly gained power in recent years.

00:21:09.484 --> 00:21:13.446
It appears that they are the ones
who were after your friend, Manami.

00:21:13.529 --> 00:21:17.408
Their founder is
Antonia Lirimonie Norfederas Papanorgas

00:21:17.492 --> 00:21:20.411
Arecroteles Cnorses Morfenoss.

00:21:20.495 --> 00:21:22.872
She's the granddaughter of multimillionaire

00:21:22.955 --> 00:21:28.336
Michael J. C. D. A. E. Morfenoss,
also known as "The Second Onassis."

00:21:28.419 --> 00:21:31.964
Their main base is the sea fortress Androala.

00:21:32.048 --> 00:21:34.425
It has a displacement of 250,000 tons.

00:21:34.509 --> 00:21:38.262
That's larger than some
of your more modest oil tankers.

00:21:39.555 --> 00:21:42.308
Kakazu is being held there.

00:21:42.391 --> 00:21:43.851
You're kidding.

00:21:47.772 --> 00:21:49.649
The time is at hand.

00:21:49.732 --> 00:21:52.443
At last, the dawn of our age has arrived!

00:21:52.527 --> 00:21:55.446
Mee-ow!!

00:22:02.662 --> 00:22:05.122
Whisked off to a world of dreams,

00:22:05.206 --> 00:22:08.125
don't hesitate, let's take off!

00:22:08.209 --> 00:22:13.589
I'm going to drop by

00:22:13.673 --> 00:22:16.259
to hang out with you

00:22:26.018 --> 00:22:31.274
All this excitement
can be found sitting in the sun

00:22:31.357 --> 00:22:36.404
Happy Sunshine,
something good is bound to happen

00:22:36.487 --> 00:22:42.034
Let's stick our happiness
into a bouncy rhythm

00:22:42.118 --> 00:22:48.374
and ride the lucky waves through summer

00:22:49.584 --> 00:22:52.086
Don't limit how far we can go

00:22:52.169 --> 00:22:55.047
| want to know how far it is

00:22:55.131 --> 00:22:59.969
Fluttering, touching, my heart is an airship

00:23:00.052 --> 00:23:02.555
Gather in the fun things

00:23:02.638 --> 00:23:05.516
and let them bloom ever brighter

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:11.022
My heart leaps at the sound

00:23:11.105 --> 00:23:14.066
of your voice

00:23:28.456 --> 00:23:30.082
Sexy swimsuits on a luxury liner,

00:23:30.166 --> 00:23:31.792
while both helicopters and missiles fly!

00:23:31.876 --> 00:23:33.502
Will the mating-seasoned love rival

00:23:33.586 --> 00:23:36.088
challenge the young woman
who out-beautifies even flowers?

00:23:36.172 --> 00:23:38.549
Next time,
"We've Come to Rescue You."

00:23:38.633 --> 00:23:42.261
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.807 --> 00:23:47.391
"See you next time!"
